defklown wrote:
> Stamina. Without stamina, you cannot do much of anything. Yet your
> stamina is not displayed. 

Since there is no stamina value. The message is a bit misleading. You 
get the "not enough stamina to move" message when you are carrying too 
much stuff, and your burden status _is_ displayed. If you are "burdened" 
you become slow, if you are "stressed", you can't go up stairs anymore, 
and if you are "overloaded" you can't move at all. So turn off that 
autopickup, or at least set it to some sensible values 
(pickup_types="=?$/, pickup_burden=b should do the trick).

